# skins/templates/kitty.conf.j2 — paint-free kitty appearance projection
# (artifact: consumer kitty, format conf, runtime output appearance/kitty.conf).
#
# COLOURS STAY IN colors.kitty. This artifact projects type, window padding and
# toplevel opacity only; it carries no paint placeholder and no literal colour.
# The conf renderer applies the documented px→pt rule (CSS reference pixel:
# value × 0.75, round half up to two decimals, clamped) and emits bare numbers,
# because kitty rejects a `px`/`pt` suffix. font_family is the first usable
# family from type.font-family (CSS-wide and non-portable system keywords are
# dropped, quotes/escapes stripped, `monospace` when nothing remains).
# background_opacity is surface.window.opacity, a unitless [0,1] number; it is
# never derived from an alpha() paint.

font_family {{SKIN_TYPE_FONT_FAMILY}}
font_size {{SKIN_TYPE_SIZE_BODY}}
window_padding_width {{SKIN_SURFACE_WINDOW_PADDING}}
background_opacity {{SKIN_SURFACE_WINDOW_OPACITY}}
